7768,1991-035,1991-035-01,90-918,1991,CHRISTINE FRANKLIN v. GWINNETT COUNTY PUBLIC SCHOOLS AND WILLIAM PRESCOTT.,2.0,1.0,"Andrew Hill, a teacher at North Gwinnett High School, sexually harassed Christine Franklin throughout her 10th grade year.  Franklin reported the harassment to teachers and school district administrators, but the administration did nothing.  They also encouraged Franklin to refrain from pressing charges.  Hill resigned in 1988 on the condition that all matters pending against him were dropped.  After Hill’s resignation the school closed its investigation.
